fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"vulkanlib/vkoperation.html#gst_vulkan_operation_begin_query","fragment":"\n\tgst_vulkan_operation_begin_query\n\n\n\tGstVulkan.VulkanOperation.prototype.begin_query\n\n\n\tGstVulkan.VulkanOperation.begin_query\n\nBegins a query operation with id in the current command buffer. If video maintenance1 extension\nis available the query will be recorded as a video inline query. If NULL is passed to base,\nthe query will be recorded as a normal query anyway.\nParameters:\na GstVulkanOperation\na VkBaseInStructure base\nquery id\nwhether the begin command was set\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nBegins a query operation with id in the current command buffer. If video maintenance1 extension\nis available the query will be recorded as a video inline query. If NULL is passed to base,\nthe query will be recorded as a normal query anyway.\nParameters:\na GstVulkan.VulkanOperation\na VkBaseInStructure base\nquery id\nwhether the begin command was set\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nBegins a query operation with id in the current command buffer. If video maintenance1 extension\nis available the query will be recorded as a video inline query. If NULL is passed to base,\nthe query will be recorded as a normal query anyway.\nParameters:\na GstVulkan.VulkanOperation\na VkBaseInStructure base\nquery id\nwhether the begin command was set\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});